OL,3,AMiley Cyrus remembers godmother Dolly
OL,4,AParton as an 'angel by my side'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiley Cyrus, Taylor Swift, Beyonce, Sir
OL,7,FPaul McCartney and Sir Elton John have
OL,8,Fled an outpouring of tributes from
OL,9,Fcelebrities and fans to Dolly Parton
OL,10,Ffollowing the music icon's death at the
OL,11,Fage of 80.
OL,13,FCyrus paid an emotional tribute to her
OL,14,Fgodmother, remembering Parton as an
OL,15,F"angel by my side". "I will always love
OL,16,Fher and want to make her proud," Cyrus
OL,17,Fwrote on instagram.
OL,19,FThe Tennessee-born singer died after "a
OL,20,Fbrief battle with cancer", her team
OL,21,Fsaid in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
